    <string name="wallpaper_scenery_preview_truth_note">Representative scenery preview only. Current rain, clouds, fog, storm, snow, Sun and Moon remain controlled by the live weather and astronomy pipeline.</string>

    <string name="wallpaper_scenery_preview_auto_detail">Auto Scene chooses a suitable scenery family from current observed-condition context and day-part. The preview shows its current resolved scenery, not a fabricated weather condition.</string>
    <string name="wallpaper_scenery_preview_open_sky_detail">A minimal foreground that keeps the live sky, Sun, Moon, stars and weather layers visually dominant.</string>
    <string name="wallpaper_scenery_preview_hills_detail">Layered natural terrain designed for atmospheric depth, sunrise, sunset, fog and changing daylight.</string>
    <string name="wallpaper_scenery_preview_village_detail">A restrained rural composition with houses, terrain, vegetation edges and a subtle path.</string>
    <string name="wallpaper_scenery_preview_farm_detail">Perspective crop fields and agricultural foreground detail with motion driven only by the current wind signal.</string>
    <string name="wallpaper_scenery_preview_river_detail">A calm river or lake composition with banks, restrained ripples and lighting response to the current scene.</string>
    <string name="wallpaper_scenery_preview_flowers_detail">Green meadow, grass and flower detail with subtle depth and current-wind-driven vegetation motion.</string>
    <string name="wallpaper_scenery_preview_urban_detail">A restrained building skyline with layered facade depth and night material response without overpowering the weather.</string>

